#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:88
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&krita; is part of the &koffice; package. &krita; is a photo retouching, image "
"editing application, but above all, a paint application that will allow you to "
"create original art on your computer as if you were working with paint and "
"brushes, pencils, pen and ink &mdash; or, at least, it will one day. We are "
"continually working on extending &krita; and making it better in every respect."
msgstr ""
"&krita; is Deel vun dat &koffice;-Paket. &krita; is en Programm för't "
"Bewerken vun Fotos, un Biller, man to allereerst en Maalprogramm, mit dat "
"sik richtige Kunst op Dien Reekner opstellen lett, so as Een redig mit "
"Farven un Pinsels, Stiften un Dint arbeidt &mdash; oder schall dat tominnst "
"warrn. &krita; warrt füdder verwiedert un schall noch beter warrn, as dat al "
"is."

